      "content": "a crisis line. yeah.\n\ni just... she would have started second grade this fall. i keep thinking about all the things that aren't going to happen now. her first day of school, her first crush, teaching her to drive someday. none of it. just gone.\n\nmy husband is trying so hard. my son is 15 and he's barely holding on himself. i look at them and i know i should want to stay. i can see it in their faces. but then i go to bed and i think — what is the point of any of it without her? like genuinely, what is the point? \n\ni'm not being dramatic. i'm just being honest. is there actually a reason to keep going when the thing that made everything make sense is just... not there anymore?",
